note=Synced to cda818e (HEAD). Covers 8a5b6e1..cda818e: the Text to image redesign (TextToImagePanel, GenerateControls, AdvancedSettings, ImageJobProgress, GenerationResultBar, ResolutionPopover), the Playground tab reset (usePlaygroundTabReset, utils/playgroundReset.ts, the store reset actions) and the Sidebar rail alignment, all committed in cda818e; notes in known-issues "Text to image redesign, tab reset and rail" and manual-checklist "Playground: Text to image redesign, tab reset and the rail". Also reflects the Audio tool merge (speech to text, text to speech and clean up or split become one Playground tool at /playground/audio; AudioPanel, AudioWaveformPlayer, utils/audioTask.ts, utils/audioWaveform.ts, speechStore per-task inputs), read from the source on 2026-11-05 and committed right after cda818e; the user tested it in the app and reports it works as intended. Its notes are in known-issues "Audio tool" and manual-checklist "Playground: Audio tool" (none ticked; offline, voice cloning, over 10 MB input and long clips are not run). Not run by the sync: tests, tsc, cargo check, the app. tasks.md and tasks-ordered.md are user-owned and not synced.
